1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,490
Late stage Core Formation ?

25
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,330
The Chaotic Broken Stars

26
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,450
can actually make copies of my body

27
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,090
with a higher cultivation than mine.

28
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,610
As expected,

29
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,970
it even replicated my artifacts.

30
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,570
Ancient God Restriction !

31
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,370
The Ji Realm is ineffective.

32
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:39,730
That means there is no consciousness to attack...

33
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,690
These things aren't alive.

34
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,130
The Ji Realm is useless,

35
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,570
they have the same artifacts as I do.

36
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,450
However,

37
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,650
this body reconstructed with the Ancient God's inheritance

38
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,170
cannot be copied by mere rocks !

39
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,330
My reconstructed Ancient God body is indeed strong

40
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:14,130
but it's still very far from what I saw in the memory inheritance.

41
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:20,530
No wonder those Soul Formation didn't force their way through this place.

42
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,850
It gets exponentially more difficult.

43
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,090
In the Land of the Ancient God

44
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,250
not only did I learn restrictions

45
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,450
but I also obtained this Ancient God body

46
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,210
and I obtained a Soul Core.

47
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,210
The Chaotic Broken Stars

48
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,610
can't stop me.

49
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,210
Now, I need to focus on forming a Nascent Soul

50
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,290
and then return to Zhao for vengeance.

51
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:54,290
Mo Yun
Qi Huang Sect disciple
Early stage Core Formation

52
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:57,210
Qian Kun
Poison Devil Palace disciple
Middle stage Core Formation

53
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,370
Why did I flee here of all places...

54
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,410
You have nowhere left to run.

55
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:08,770
The Chaotic Broken Stars is famous in the Sea of Devils.

56
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:12,570
I’ve never heard of someone crossing it.

57
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,370
Don’t tell me you want to try ?

58
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,690
Senior,

59
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,970
Junior was lucky enough

60
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,210
to barely escape the Poison Demon Palace.

61
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:23,970
Why must you kill me ?

62
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:28,450
I'm merely following orders.

63
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:32,330
You should blame yourself for taking something you shouldn’t have !

64
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,810
This is something that belongs to my master !

65
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,370
Does it make a difference ?

66
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:42,250
It’s just a sect that was long destroyed.

67
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:45,690
You refuse to be the palace lord’s concubine

68
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:48,210
and foolishly stole the treasure furnace.

69
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:53,050
Don’t blame this old man for being ruthless !

70
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,530
Senior, if you continue

71
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,690
Junior will enter the Chaotic Broken Stars

72
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,170
and you'll leave empty-handed.

73
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,010
Senior,

74
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,890
this jade slip

75
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,730
contains the most pill recipes of the Qi Huang Sect.

76
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:09,250
It's as valuable as the furnace.

77
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,370
Will you let me go?

78
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,770
if I give you this jade slip ?

79
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,130
Fine,

80
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,930
give me the jade slip.

81
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,930
Once I confirm it’s real,

82
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,570
I’ll let you leave.

83
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:27,050
Please Senior, retreat 1000 zhang

84
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,130
and I’ll leave the jade slip here

85
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,450
after I leave.

86
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:33,130
Nonsense ! I don't have time to play games with you !

87
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,530
Senior, how could you break your word ?

88
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,330
Since you’re so sensible,

89
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:48,730
I’ll make sure you die comfortably !

90
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,090
That’s...

91
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,450
A person !?

92
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,690
How did he cross the Chaotic Broken Stars ?

93
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,730
I once saw a Nascent Soul Elder from the Poison Demon Palace

94
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:07,210
being anihilated by the Chaotic Broken Stars.

95
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,610
Even his Nascent Soul couldn’t escape...

96
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,810
What cultivation does this person have ?

97
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:15,610
Could he be Soul Formation ?

98
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:21,050
Junior Mo Yun of the Qi Huang Sect

99
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,250
pays respects to Senior.

100
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:25,650
Junior Qian Kun 5th-generation disciple of Poison Demon Palace

101
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,970
pays respects to Senior.

102
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:31,010
What’s the nearest city from here ?

103
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,810
Senior, 300 000 li west of here

104
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,930
is Qilin City.

105
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:38,170
Junior can guide you there.

106
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,770
As long as this person is here,

107
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:44,210
Qian Kun won’t dare to attack me.

108
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:49,770
Does Qilin City have Soul Formation cultivators ?

109
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,210
Of course not !

110
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:54,450
Senior, Qilin City doesn't have any Soul Formation cultivators.

111
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:57,810
Even among the 10 major cities of the Sea of Devils,

112
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,730
there are very few.

113
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,530
Ever since

114
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:03,490
several famous Soul Formation Devil Lords

115
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,730
disappeared within the Chaotic Broken Stars,

116
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:09,050
Soul Formation cultivators became a rare sight in the Sea of Devils.

117
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:12,650
Which Soul Formation cultivators

118
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:14,250
disappeared in this Chaotic Broken Stars ?

119
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,050
Senior,

120
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,730
200 years ago

121
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,410
Poison Devil City Lord, Meng Qingfan,

122
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,730
Devil Lord of Qi Mei City, Duanmu Ji,

123
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:24,370
the Xuan Tian Sect Leader, the Six Desires Devil Lord

124
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,970
and Ancient Emperor, Gu Di

125
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,890
all agreed to meet in the Chaotic Broken Stars

126
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,930
and vanished.

127
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,410
Their disciples

128
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,410
have been looking for them for 200 years

129
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,930
but didn't find a single clue.

130
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:43,690
I didn't think that 200 years would go by like that.

131
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,730
So Hunchback Meng was your Ancestor ?

132
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,250
This is bad...

133
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:53,730
The Ancestor went around the world

134
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,170
making countless enemies...

135
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,490
Judging by his attitude,

136
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,410
he must have a grudge with the Ancestor.

137
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:17,050
If the word spreads out that I walked out of the Chaotic Broken Stars,

138
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,050
trouble is bound to follow me.

139
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,290
Brat, don’t run !

140
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,930
Let Uncle Xu devour you

141
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:28,090
to repay Master's favor of letting me out again !

142
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,450
This...

143
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:35,010
This artifact is actually a Nascent Soul slave ?

144
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,930
With the Ancient God Tactic,

145
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,570
my body can absorb 80% of a Golden Core

146
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:03,610
and convert the remaining 20% to spiritual energy.

147
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,330
That's really impressive.

148
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,850
Senior,

149
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,850
Junior has a residence in Qilin City.

150
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:23,570
With Junior's status as a resident,

151
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:25,050
Senior

152
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:27,650
doesn't need to worry about anything.

153
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:36,210
This restriction activates every 3 days.

154
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,010
When it activated, your spiritual energy will be in chaos.

155
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,530
If I don't stop it within 15 minutes,

156
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,370
you'll instantly turn to a puddle of blood.

157
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,130
Don't try to pull any tricks.

158
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,250
Lead the way.

159
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,530
The legend says

160
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,450
that Qilin City already existed before the mist

161
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:07,410
Qilin City
Sea of Devils

162
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,450
of the Sea of Devils condensed.

163
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:11,050
It's one of the 10 major cities in the Sea of Devils.

164
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,010
Take me to your residence.

165
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,890
Jade token.

166
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:22,730
You can enter.

167
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,330
Senior,

168
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,770
Yun’er fell in love with you at first sight,

169
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,250
I’d never betray you.

170
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:59,090
Could you please lift this restriction ?

171
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,130
Don’t do anything unnecessary.

172
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:08,490
Junior... won’t dare !

173
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,930
I won’t stay in the Sea of Devils for too long.

174
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:15,170
I'll lift the restriction when I leave.

175
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:20,490
If you say anything about me coming out of the Chaotic Broken Stars,

176
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,610
don’t blame me for being ruthless.

177
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,050
Understood, Senior...

178
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,730
Once Tuo Sen leaves the Land of the Ancient God,

179
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,810
he will look for me for the memory inheritance.

180
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:08,050
I obtained quite a few artifacts in this trip.

181
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,410
No matter what,

182
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,010
I must quickly form my Nascent Soul.

183
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,730
These 9 artifacts

184
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,530
still have lingering Divine Sense

185
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:19,050
even if their owners are dead

186
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,050
so I can't use them.

187
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:38,090
This one might be worth a try.

188
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,330
Hurry up, leave !

189
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:09,210
With this artifact to help us,

190
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,890
Master is sure to form a Nascent Soul !

191
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:15,210
Master, are you going to kill that girl ?

192
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,610
Just ask me !

193
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,970
Shut up.

194
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:24,050
Nascent Soul is imminent.

195
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:25,170
Just to be safe,

196
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,690
I'll find the materials to refine a Restriction Flag.

197
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,250
Shopkeeper, I’ll take this.

198
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,810
Fellow cultivator has good taste !

199
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:06,410
She’s clearly plotting something.

200
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:08,610
Master, you must strike first.

201
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,170
Quickly send me to devour her !

202
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,490
Not yet.

203
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,170
I want to see

204
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,890
if anyone in Qilin City

205
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:17,490
can break my restriction.

206
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:21,610
Treasure Refining Pavilion

207
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,930
Master is an Enlightened of Restriction Mountain.

208
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:23,690
No one in this shabby city could possibly break it.

209
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:29,250
Fellow cultivator, take a look at our talismans and pills.

210
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:46,730
With Flood Dragon bones

211
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,090
the formation

212
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,490
will resist Core Formation cultivators for days.

213
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,410
The core has healing properties.

214
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:53,850
The marrow is even more precious, it's concentrated spiritual energy.

215
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:56,090
I took the liberty of crafting it

216
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,450
so that Senior may use it.

217
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,850
It's been 200 years...

218
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:04,460
I wonder where she is now...

219
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,010
Senior !

220
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:08,450
This hide was stripped from the Flood Dragon

221
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,770
right after its death.

222
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,330
The cultivator who skinned the dragon

223
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,890
was a famous Foundation Establishment cultivator

224
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,810
200 years ago in the outskirts of the Sea of Devils.

225
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:21,570
He had a breakthrough despite being chased by Core Formation cultivators  !

226
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,570
After he reached Core Formation,

227
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,890
he slaughtered all his pursuers

228
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:29,450
and he even forced a Middle stage Core Formation

229
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,890
to use the Hundred Days Execution Order !

230
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,930
Get me everything on this list.

231
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,050
Right away !

232
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,810
Senior,

233
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:52,890
can you really break the restriction ?

234
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:08,090
Come up,

235
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:11,170
I will break the restriction.

236
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,370
But you must tell me

237
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:17,810
who placed this restriction on you.

238
00:17:26,020 --> 00:19:42,010
You might be wondering why Wang Lin says that he needs to focus on Nascent Soul when we weren't ever shown him advance further than Early stage Core Formation.
There are 2 breakthroughs in the novel during the Land of the Ancient God that weren't shown in the donghua.

The first one happens in episode 31 when Wang Lin took 7 years to learn restrictions and his hair turned white due to the stress. At that time, his cultivation naturally broke through to Middle stage Core Formation.

The second one happens in episode 34 when Wang Lin obtained the crystal of memory inheritance that the Sky Devil Magician condensed by killing the Six Desires Devil Lord. Right after that he hides for some time in the Heaven Defying Bead to cultivate and let some time pass because he was being chased. During that time he learns to use the Ancient God Tactic to devour Golden Cores he has in his bag of holding along with the pills Li Muwan made for him and he reached Late stage Core Formation.

When he went back to find Ma Liang's corpse in the previous episode, he recovers his Golden Core for his new body. Since it's his own, he's able to merge it with his new body and he automatically becomes Late stage Core Formation again.

239
00:17:34,470 --> 00:17:38,600
I've had my share of wounds,

240
00:17:36,510 --> 00:17:38,600
now I want to fight back.

241
00:17:38,430 --> 00:17:42,160
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

242
00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:48,080
that's blocking all my hopes

243
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:48,080
for life ?

244
00:17:49,630 --> 00:17:53,840
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

245
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:53,840
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

246
00:17:53,910 --> 00:17:57,240
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

247
00:17:57,350 --> 00:18:03,240
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

248
00:18:00,070 --> 00:18:03,240
out of reach.

249
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:08,720
Immortals

250
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:08,720
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

251
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:12,760
Renegades

252
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:12,760
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

253
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:16,600
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

254
00:18:14,460 --> 00:18:16,600
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

255
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:20,720
because I don't see the harm in that.

256
00:18:22,470 --> 00:18:28,520
My new body opens its eyes

257
00:18:24,990 --> 00:18:28,520
and awakens from its dream.

258
00:18:28,390 --> 00:18:36,080
I have overcome many trials

259
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:36,080
to get this body back.

260
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:43,720
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

261
00:18:40,070 --> 00:18:43,720
I can still see.

262
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:53,080
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

